{"3986360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exorcide INC.", "steam_appid": 3986360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/164a9e6d8ac4103a014a62a2d83ec819.avif?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=258 /></span><strong>Exorcide INC</strong> is a <strong>6-player</strong> co-op horror experience where physics, proximity voice chat, and fear collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: locate artifacts haunted by ghost souls and deliver them to extraction zones. The catch? You're hunted by adaptive monsters that react to sound and movement. Survive by mastering a combination of magical tools, environmental manipulation, and silent coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/53614397c9ce73117ee9cd49d77f7395.webp?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=58 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/e76243e76abba14e20a6eb1eddaca958.poster.avif?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/e76243e76abba14e20a6eb1eddaca958.webm?t=1758228745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/e76243e76abba14e20a6eb1eddaca958.mp4?t=1758228745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters are can waiting you behind any door!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 unique monsters and 1 uniq boss in each locations. All mob with its own abilities and unique skills, find your approach to avoid falling into their trap and escape alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/ba052bb20182ef06db710b6c12e38677.webp?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=58 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/9e14bb9564491ab7e7b9b7ea7bde69d1.poster.avif?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/9e14bb9564491ab7e7b9b7ea7bde69d1.webm?t=1758228745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/9e14bb9564491ab7e7b9b7ea7bde69d1.mp4?t=1758228745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Charge energy and use it wisely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful magical abilities fueled by plasma collected from ghosts. Carry four at once, each with a unique cost. Use voice commands for immersive activation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/58b1802cb5f32413a6db5572ab947463.webp?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/c5385d450569905f7cf950e660216222.poster.avif?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/c5385d450569905f7cf950e660216222.webm?t=1758228745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/c5385d450569905f7cf950e660216222.mp4?t=1758228745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>...Finally, fifth-grade physics proved useful.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt artifacts haunted by souls. Deliver them with care to the extraction zone. Earn your liberation from the corporate yoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/c0847cc1535a8970cdccf78e42b6d2c1.webp?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/97f117ed4aabe70f31fa361b531c08ec.poster.avif?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/97f117ed4aabe70f31fa361b531c08ec.webm?t=1758228745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/97f117ed4aabe70f31fa361b531c08ec.mp4?t=1758228745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>...Assemble your crew on the airship.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mobile hub awaits repair. Return from missions to upgrade gear and skills. Here, you’ll recover, accept new corporate tasks from the map, and embark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986360/extras/0a9fd7112f9c8720e39aed5064917763.webp?t=1758228745\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\